---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-surface border-t border-line mt-20">
  <div class="split-rule"></div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
      <!-- Column 1: Editorial Identity -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center" aria-label="Beranda bedahgadget.id">
          <img
            src="/brand/svg/lockup-horizontal-light.svg"
            alt="bedahgadget.id"
            class="h-8 w-auto theme-light-only"
            width="195"
            height="32"
          />
          <img
            src="/brand/svg/lockup-horizontal-dark.svg"
            alt="bedahgadget.id"
            class="h-8 w-auto theme-dark-only"
            width="195"
            height="32"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          Publikasi jurnalisme teknis yang membedah arsitektur silikon, skema jalur daya motherboard,
          mekanika sasis, dan termodinamika pendinginan laptop berdasarkan kasus nyata di meja kerja.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-1 font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums space-y-1">
          <div>ISSN-DIGITAL / ARSIP BEDAH PERANGKAT KERAS</div>
          <div>REFERENSI: SKEMA ELEKTRIS, BOARDVIEW &amp; DOKUMENTASI FISIK</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Rubrik & Indeks -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">
          Indeks Rubrik
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/bedah/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-ink-secondary hover:text-accent-link transition-colors">
              Bedah Anatomi Hardware
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/ai/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-ink-secondary hover:text-accent-link transition-colors">
              Arsitektur AI &amp; Silikon
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/review/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-ink-secondary hover:text-accent-link transition-colors">
              Review &amp; Checklist Laptop
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/tentang/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-ink-secondary hover:text-accent-link transition-colors">
              Metodologi &amp; Afiliasi Workshop
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/rss.xml" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-ink-secondary hover:text-accent-link transition-colors font-mono text-xs">
              Umpan Sindikasi RSS (XML)
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Afiliasi Workshop FixNow.id -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <div class="p-5 bg-elevated border border-line space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line pb-2">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">
              Mitra Workshop Servis
            </span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-muted">BANDUNG</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Seluruh dokumentasi kerusakan fisik, jalur VRM, dan sampel sasis di
            <strong>bedahgadget.id</strong> dianalisis dari kasus perbaikan nyata di workshop
            <a
              href="https://fixnow.id/?utm_source=bedahgadget&utm_medium=footer_text"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="text-accent-link font-semibold underline underline-offset-2"
            >
              FixNow.id Bandung
            </a>.
          </p>
          <dl class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-secondary space-y-1.5 pt-1 tabular-nums">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-ink-muted inline">ALAMAT: </dt>
              <dd class="inline">Jl. Manteron No. 12, Sukaluyu, Kec. Cibeunying Kaler, Kota Bandung 40123</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-ink-muted inline">JAM KERJA: </dt>
              <dd class="inline">Sen–Kam 09.00–17.00 | Jum 13.00–16.00 | Sab–Min 10.00–16.00 WIB</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-ink-muted inline">WHATSAPP: </dt>
              <dd class="inline">
                <a
                  href="https://wa.me/6285139506080?text=Halo%20FixNow.id,%20saya%20membaca%20artikel%20di%20bedahgadget.id%20dan%20ingin%20konsultasi%20servis%20laptop."
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                  class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-accent-link font-semibold hover:underline"
                >
                  0851-3950-6080 (Cek Awal Gratis)
                </a>
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-line flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted tabular-nums">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} bedahgadget.id. Hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.</p>
      <p>Standar publikasi: Tanpa iklan sponsor tersembunyi, berbasis pengamatan teknis objektif.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
